# Privy app id for the email/Google login (embedded Stellar wallet).
# Create an app at https://dashboard.privy.io, enable Stellar under
# "Embedded wallets", add this site's origin to the allowed domains, and
# paste the App ID here. While unset, the email option in the login chooser
# is shown as "Soon" and doesn't open Privy.
#
# PUBLIC_ vars are inlined by Vite at BUILD time. On Cloudflare Workers
# Builds set it as a build variable, not a runtime secret.
PUBLIC_PRIVY_APP_ID=

# WalletConnect / Reown Cloud project id. Required for Freighter's own
# mobile in-app browser to be able to connect at all — see the comment on
# WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID in src/lib/stellar/config.ts for why. Create a
# free project at https://cloud.reown.com, add this site's origin under
# "Allowed domains", and paste the Project ID here. While unset, the login
# chooser's "Browser wallet" option works everywhere except Freighter's
# mobile app browser.
PUBLIC_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=
